# sapintegrationsuite_integration_assessment_deployment_model (Data Source)

Returns the Id and description of a deployment model, for example to link application and
technology instances to it. Deployment models belong to SAP's Integration Solution Advisory
Methodology taxonomy; the Ids differ between tenants, the names do not.

**Status:** supported. SAP's Entities API specification on the Business Accelerator Hub
documents this entity, and its requests were verified on a tenant. No opt-in switch is needed.

Names are compared exactly, including case. The plan fails when no entry or more than one entry
has the name.

